sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant FE as Frontend (HTML/JS)
    participant BE as Backend (Flask)
    participant PKC as PKC + Decoder
    participant VLM as Qwen2-VL (merged + LoRA)

    U->>FE: pick seq + frame
    FE->>BE: POST /api/load_frame
    BE->>PKC: 5-frame RD/RA/AD → x9 logits
    PKC->>BE: object list + GT mask
    BE->>FE: GT (red) + PKC (yellow dashed) + chat history
    U->>FE: "图中是否有目标？"
    FE->>BE: POST /api/chat
    BE->>PKC: re-encode (if needed)
    BE->>VLM: prompt = system + image + obj_text + Q
    VLM->>BE: generated answer
    BE->>BE: rule-based override for numeric QA
    BE->>FE: answer
